    "role": "paragraph",
    "segment": "The Council created an inventory of components and formed a matrix with the features of all past  and  planned  projects. Then, each feature was rated in terms of whether it had been implemented and was still needed, had been implemented but was no longer needed, or had not been implemented but was still needed. Those features that were needed and were common to more than one project were targeted for reuse. In fact, some were redesigned to make them more reusable. The Council met every week for two hours to make component selections, inspect design documentation for those components already in the repository, and to monitor the levels of reuse in the department's projects.",
