    "role": "paragraph",
    "segment": "SEL can use the severity information in failure reports to better understand its maintenance process. Given that SEL collects data from all phases of its software development projects and failure reports indicate defect severity as major defect with no workaround; major defect, but workaround exists; cosmetic defect, the team can quantify the distribution of defects across these categories, determine whether high-severity defects have workarounds, assess the impact of workarounds on users, and track severity trends over time and across phases to evaluate maintenance performance.",
    "citations": [
